comment = "Finally a 24 palette not related to some kind of punk style, some colors based originally on old 8 bit game art, now edited to work nicely together. Each ramp shares a dark color, and the purple and pink share a shading color. The palette works together on itself in many ways and could be used as many smaller palettes, split up in different ways."
